      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[51]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 856,
      "endIndex": 876,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "6. 可以按需自动创建新的知识子模块。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00052",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[52]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 876,
      "endIndex": 909,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   只有在第一次产生真正值得保存的内容时才创建，不创建空目录。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00053",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[53]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 909,
      "endIndex": 919,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   新模块必须：",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00054",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[54]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 919,
      "endIndex": 935,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 有明确稳定的主题边界",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
