      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[57]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 971,
      "endIndex": 972,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00058",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[58]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 972,
      "endIndex": 985,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "6.1 命名与编号规范：",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00059",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[59]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 985,
      "endIndex": 1032,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 00_Index 内治理、索引和审计文件使用两位顺序号：00_、01_、02_……",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00060",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[60]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1032,
      "endIndex": 1098,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 01_Knowledge、02_Mistakes、03_Projects 中的二级模块使用两位顺序号：01_、02_……",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00061",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[61]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1098,
      "endIndex": 1135,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 二级模块内文件使用三位顺序号：001_、002_、003_……",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00062",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[62]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1135,
      "endIndex": 1180,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 04_Daily 按 YYYY/MM 目录组织，月份目录内文件使用三位顺序号。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00063",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[63]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1180,
      "endIndex": 1223,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 新增内容优先进入既有模块；仅在现有模块无法合理容纳时创建下一个顺序号模块。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00064",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[64]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1223,
      "endIndex": 1264,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 文件迁移到其他模块时，在目标模块按下一可用编号重新编号，避免重复编号。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
