      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "    - “毕业设计之前为什么这么决定”",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00093",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[93]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1747,
      "endIndex": 1801,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "    等涉及个人历史的问题时，应优先搜索 Google Drive 知识库，而不是只依赖 Memory。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00094",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[94]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1801,
      "endIndex": 1802,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00095",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[95]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1802,
      "endIndex": 1839,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "11. Memory 只作为导航和长期偏好层，不把它当作完整历史数据库。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00096",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[96]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1839,
      "endIndex": 1882,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "    具体技术历史、错误和项目事实优先以 Google Drive 中的记录为准。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00097",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[97]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1882,
      "endIndex": 1883,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00098",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[98]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1883,
      "endIndex": 1948,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "12. 如果一次写操作涉及不确定的覆盖、删除、大规模重构或可能破坏现有知识结构，应先询问我；普通新增、更新、索引维护可以直接执行",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00099",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[99]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1948,
      "endIndex": 1949,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00100",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[100]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1949,
      "endIndex": 1964,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "13. 跨会话长期执行规则：",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00101",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[101]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 1964,
      "endIndex": 2036,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 在技术学习、代码、配置、故障排查或项目讨论中，只要一个独立问题已经基本收口且具有长期价值，就应主动进行知识沉淀，不等待再次要求保存。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00102",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[102]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2036,
      "endIndex": 2097,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 执行知识库操作时，优先读取 ChatGPT/00_Index 下的治理规则和知识库索引，并以其中当前规则为准。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00103",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[103]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2097,
      "endIndex": 2156,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 根据治理规则自行判断是新增、更新已有内容、创建新模块还是维护索引；已有同主题内容时优先更新，避免重复堆叠。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00104",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[104]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2156,
      "endIndex": 2237,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 涉及“以前问过什么、犯过什么错、以前如何解决、项目为何这样决策”等个人历史问题时，优先查询 Google Drive 知识库，不只依赖 Memory。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00105",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[105]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2237,
      "endIndex": 2295,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 知识库操作不得打断当前问题的正常回答；优先完成当前问题，再在同一轮中完成适合的普通新增、更新和索引维护。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00106",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[106]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2295,
      "endIndex": 2344,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 删除、大规模覆盖、结构重构等高风险操作必须先询问；普通新增、更新、索引维护可直接执行。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00107",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[107]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2344,
      "endIndex": 2418,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "   - 如果 Google Drive 或当前治理规则无法访问，不得猜测或虚构已有知识库内容；正常完成当前回答，并明确说明本次知识库操作未完成。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00108",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[108]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2418,
      "endIndex": 2420,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "。",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00109",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[109]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 2420,
      "endIndex": 2421,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
